{"id":"498d9a7dee7a4d0a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-von-neumann.md","title":"von Neumann Ergodic Theorem","display":"thm-von-neumann — von Neumann Ergodic Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-von-neumann","aliases":["58-thm-von-neumann"],"display":"thm-von-neumann — von Neumann Ergodic Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-von-neumann"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-von-neumann</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-von-neumann — von Neumann Ergodic Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective\">../batch05/58-df-surjective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,B,+_H,\\odot_H,U,P,F\\in V\">\\(H,B,+_H,\\odot_H,U,P,F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> (fully explicit Hilbert-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S\\)</span> (designated-structure predicates defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x,y)\\coloneqq B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(B(x,y)\\coloneqq B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>，向量加法与数乘均按指定运算图求值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+_Hy\\coloneqq+_H(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(x+_Hy\\coloneqq+_H(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\odot_Hx\\coloneqq\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\">\\(a\\odot_Hx\\coloneqq\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S(a,U,x,n;H,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_H,H\\times H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_H,\\mathbb C\\times H,H)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land a,x\\in H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists z\\in H\\;\\exists u,s\\in H^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall y\\in H\\;(+_H(\\langle z,y\\rangle)=y=+_H(\\langle y,z\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land u(0)=x\\land s(0)=z\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(u(i+1)=U(u(i))\\land s(i+1)=+_H(\\langle s(i),u(i)\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land a=\\odot_H(\\langle1/n,s(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S(a,U,x,n;H,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_H,H\\times H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_H,\\mathbb C\\times H,H)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land a,x\\in H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists z\\in H\\;\\exists u,s\\in H^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall y\\in H\\;(+_H(\\langle z,y\\rangle)=y=+_H(\\langle y,z\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land u(0)=x\\land s(0)=z\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(u(i+1)=U(u(i))\\land s(i+1)=+_H(\\langle s(i),u(i)\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land a=\\odot_H(\\langle1/n,s(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S(U;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(U,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\nB(U(x),U(y))=B(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S(U;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(U,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\nB(U(x),U(y))=B(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthogonal\\text{-}projection\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S(P,F;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land F\\subseteq H\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,H,H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;(P(P(x))=P(x))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land F=\\{P(x)\\mid x\\in H\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall y\\in F\\;\nB\\!\\left(\nx+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)),y\n\\right)=0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthogonal\\text{-}projection\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S(P,F;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land F\\subseteq H\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,H,H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;(P(P(x))=P(x))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land F=\\{P(x)\\mid x\\in H\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall y\\in F\\;\nB\\!\\left(\nx+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)),y\n\\right)=0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann}\\ \\vdash\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S(U;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists!P\\in H^H\\;\\exists F\\subseteq H\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;F=\\{y\\in H\\mid U(y)=y\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S(\nP,F;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nN\\leq n\\to n\\neq0\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\n\\exists a\\in H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S(a,U,x,n;H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\n\\sqrt{B(a+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)),a+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)))}\n&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann}\\ \\vdash\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S(U;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists!P\\in H^H\\;\\exists F\\subseteq H\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;F=\\{y\\in H\\mid U(y)=y\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S(\nP,F;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nN\\leq n\\to n\\neq0\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\n\\exists a\\in H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S(a,U,x,n;H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\n\\sqrt{B(a+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)),a+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)))}\n&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>von Neumann's theorem gives strong (pointwise <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span>) convergence of the Cesàro averages; operator-norm convergence is not asserted.</li>\n<li>It is a Hilbert space result.</li>\n<li>The unitary, projection, and convergence clauses now share one explicit complex Hilbert structure. The undefined operator class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(H)\">\\(\\mathcal L(H)\\)</span>, adjoint symbol, range accessor, and unrelated hidden Hilbert witnesses have been eliminated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,B,+_H,\\odot_H,U,P,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Surjective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"B(x,y)\\coloneqq B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"x+_Hy\\coloneqq+_H(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\odot_Hx\\coloneqq\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S(a,U,x,n;H,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_H,H\\times H,H)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_H,\\mathbb C\\times H,H)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land a,x\\in H\\\\\n&\\land\\exists z\\in H\\;\\exists u,s\\in H^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall y\\in H\\;(+_H(\\langle z,y\\rangle)=y=+_H(\\langle y,z\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land u(0)=x\\land s(0)=z\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(u(i+1)=U(u(i))\\land s(i+1)=+_H(\\langle s(i),u(i)\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land a=\\odot_H(\\langle1/n,s(n)\\rangle)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S(U;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(U,H,H)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\nB(U(x),U(y))=B(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthogonal\\text{-}projection\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S(P,F;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land F\\subseteq H\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,H,H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;(P(P(x))=P(x))\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land F=\\{P(x)\\mid x\\in H\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall y\\in F\\;\nB\\!\\left(\nx+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)),y\n\\right)=0.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann}\\ \\vdash\\;&\n\\mathrm{UnitaryStructure}_S(U;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&{}\\to\\exists!P\\in H^H\\;\\exists F\\subseteq H\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&F=\\{y\\in H\\mid U(y)=y\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{OrthogonalProjectionStructure}_S(\nP,F;H,B,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nN\\leq n\\to n\\neq0\\land\\\\\n&\\hspace{13mm}\n\\exists a\\in H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{UnitaryCesaroValue}_S(a,U,x,n;H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\n\\sqrt{B(a+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)),a+_H((-1)\\odot_HP(x)))}\n<\\varepsilon\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(H)","display":false}],"bytes":3525,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4479","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-von-neumann.md|58-thm-von-neumann]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","36d7463d215be751","9f8cb046321ba311","f67456d74b418241"]}